// ============ The locked positioning lines (C17) ============
// The founder locked these two lines word for word, and they always travel
// together: the main line says what the product replaces, the support line says
// what it holds. They used to be retyped on each surface, which is how the
// landing page drifted back to a generic headline while the auth cover carried
// the locked one. One module, so a surface cannot half-quote them.
//
// Do not edit the text without the founder's decision. `tests/ui-no-em-dash`
// exempts the main line by its exact source spelling, so a reworded copy also
// fails that gate.

/** The main line. */
export const HERO_HEADLINE = 'Plan Indian trips together — not in a chaotic group chat.'

/** The support line. It never appears without the main line. */
export const HERO_SUPPORT = 'Every stop, hour and rupee in one plan your group can actually follow.'
